Package: fpal
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libpam-runtime, dbus
Description: Fingerprint Auth for Linux
 A from-scratch userspace fingerprint driver, command line tool and PAM
 module for Match-on-Chip fingerprint sensors (currently EgisTec / LighTuning
 1c7a:0587). No libusb or libfprint is needed. Fingerprints on the sensor
 are only added or deleted one at a time, after an explicit command and a
 typed confirmation.
 .
 Installing the package does not change the PAM stack. Run "sudo fpal setup"
 to enable it (it uses pam-auth-update) and see /usr/share/doc/fpal/usage.md.
